This licence covers the code in this repository. It does not cover the
third-party material the tool uses, which keeps its own licence:

- base-styles/liberty.json: the OpenFreeMap Liberty style, MIT,
  Copyright (c) 2023 Zsolt Ero (https://github.com/hyperknot/openfreemap-styles).
  It is forked from OSM Liberty (https://github.com/maputnik/osm-liberty), BSD
  licence, whose look derives from OSM Bright (Mapbox, BSD; design CC BY 3.0)
  and the OpenMapTiles styles (code BSD 3-Clause, design CC BY 4.0).
- Map data: (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, Open Database Licence (ODbL).
- Tile schema: (c) OpenMapTiles.
- Fonts: Noto Sans, SIL Open Font License 1.1, served by OpenFreeMap.
- Icons: the OpenFreeMap sprite (Maki icons, CC0 1.0).
- MapTiler tiles and fonts, when used: MapTiler's terms.
